WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.518
Unpinned shows what a photo gives away before you share it,

00:00:04.518 --> 00:00:07.868
and makes a clean copy, all inside your browser.

00:00:07.868 --> 00:00:10.800
Nothing is uploaded, and it works offline.

00:00:11.803 --> 00:00:15.073
This made-up sample is a photo for a sofa sale.

00:00:15.073 --> 00:00:19.736
Unpinned finds the exact spot where it was taken, the owner's name,

00:00:19.736 --> 00:00:25.163
the phone's serial number, the time, the altitude, and a hidden preview image.

00:00:26.165 --> 00:00:28.465
Each finding says what it reveals.

00:00:28.465 --> 00:00:32.727
The coordinates often point to a home, a school or a workplace,

00:00:32.727 --> 00:00:37.125
and a serial number links every photo taken with the same device.

00:00:38.127 --> 00:00:43.800
Make a clean copy keeps the picture data byte for byte and leaves the metadata out,

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:45.919
so the quality does not change.

00:00:45.919 --> 00:00:48.926
Then the copy is checked again: no location,

00:00:48.926 --> 00:00:52.207
names, serial numbers or hidden previews remain.

00:00:53.209 --> 00:00:55.942
Save the copy, and share that one instead.

00:00:55.942 --> 00:00:59.065
Unpinned cannot see clues in the picture itself,

00:00:59.065 --> 00:01:02.969
such as a street sign or a reflection, and the page says so.
